  "description": "SATJOO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C118 H182 Gd6 Mn4 N2 O50 P6,3(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 10 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.594-4.012 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.13-115.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C118H182Gd6Mn4N2O50P6·3(C2H3N). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
